# ==============================================================================
# Git Ignore - Core Siaga Padang (Geospatial & Evacuation Simulation)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Virtual Environment & Python Runtime
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
env/
venv/
ENV/
.env
.venv/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# Bytecode & Cache Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Cache Data Jaringan & API (OSMnx / HTTP Cache)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Folder cache OSMnx yang memuat ratusan respons JSON lokal
cache/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Skrip Uji Coba Sementara (Lokal)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Eksperimen lokal yang belum layak di-commit (lihat docs/aturan_proyek.md).
/scratch/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Paket Distribusi Database
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# hasil_build/ranah_siaga_v4.db (±30 MB) dan dataset_manifest.json di-commit. Zip-nya dibuat
# ulang oleh build_db.py dan didistribusikan terpisah; checksum-nya tercatat di manifest.
*.db.zip
# Paket kiriman untuk tim mobile & backend (dibuat ulang dari hasil_build/ + docs/)
hasil_build/kirim_*.zip

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4b. Data Mentah BPBD (±1,4 GB: KRB 2023-2027, shapefile TES/TEA, PDF)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Input build_db.py. Simpan salinannya di luar git (lihat docs/aturan_proyek.md).
# hasil_build/ranah_siaga_v4.db tetap di-commit sebagai keluaran build.
Data BPBD/

# Peta contoh rute (acak, dibuat ulang dengan analisis/contoh_rute_evakuasi.py)
analisis/output/contoh_rute_*.html

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Editor, IDE & Tooling
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
.gemini/
*.log

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Sistem Operasi (Windows & macOS)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
._*
